hypothesis: v039 gained from having two teachers but we do not know WHICH member did
  the work. reset4k alone is the weaker model on dozken public (0.6538 against 0.6569)
  yet it is the one trained against a different loss, which is the stated source of
  the ensemble diversity. If reset4k alone matches the pair, the gain is loss-diversity
  and one member suffices; if the pair beats it, it is genuine ensembling and adding
  members is worth the replay cost v042 is paying. Either answer tells us where to
  spend the next hour, which is the point of spending one now.
